cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this formalization, please cite it as below.
title: 'Centrally-Excited-Random-Walk: a Lean 4 formalization of limit shapes of centrally excited random
  walks'
abstract: A Lean 4 / mathlib formalization of Limit shapes for centrally excited walks by Bou-Rabee, Nguyen,
  Peres and Singh, with the earlier two-author source pin preserved. Every theorem, lemma and proposition
  of the paper is proved, in 29 checked declarations. The production library has no sorry or custom axiom.
  Separate Mathlib-only comparator challenges contain seven intentional statement-level proof holes and
  have completed solutions.
type: software
authors:
- family-names: Bou-Rabee
  given-names: Ahmed
- family-names: Peres
  given-names: Yuval
keywords:
- Lean
- mathlib
- formal verification
- excited random walk
- limit shape
- local time
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/nitromannitol/Centrally-Excited-Random-Walk
